{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[00:11.96] Sober up or lose myself in the process\n[00:14.94] Twenty-seven club lookin' good, to be honest\n[00:18.02] I don't know what to do, I'm so confused\n[00:20.98] Running out of time, I may blow my fuse\n[00:24.10] Can't eat, can't sleep, lately I've been feelin' nauseous\n[00:27.00] Pills in my designer bag, I'm tempted to pop them\n[00:29.96] I'm goin' in circles, it's a never-ending cycle\n[00:32.96] Help me, help me\n[00:35.98] Fuck peer pressure, this is pressure from Hell\n[00:38.64] You don't wanna know the feeling, but I know it too well\n[00:41.76] I remember I was chilling up on top of the world\n[00:44.64] No fear of heights, up until the day that I fell, yeah\n[00:48.14] I don't really know if I could function\n[00:51.10] I thought being fucked up all the time was funny\n[00:53.98] Then it turned nothing into something, uh\n[00:57.00] Next thing you know, I'm a fucked up druggie\n[01:00.20] Relationships ain't make it better, I was getting hurt\n[01:02.80] I ain't feel like ventin' to my friends, so I talk to Perc's\n[01:05.98] They were lying to me when they told me that it wouldn't work\n[01:08.96] Fucking up my confidence, I'm feeling like a loser, yeah\n[01:12.16] Sober up or lose myself in the process\n[01:14.94] Twenty-seven club lookin' good, to be honest\n[01:18.02] I don't know what to do, I'm so confused\n[01:21.04] Running out of time, I may blow my fuse\n[01:23.62] Can't eat, can't sleep, lately I've been feelin' nauseous\n[01:26.98] Pills in my designer bag, I'm tempted to pop them\n[01:30.04] I'm goin' in circles, it's a never-ending cycle\n[01:32.96] Help me, help me","words":[[11.96,12.34,"Sober"],[12.42,12.52,"up"],[12.6,12.62,"or"],[12.72,13.02,"lose"],[13.1,13.78,"myself"],[13.92,13.98,"in"],[14.02,14.08,"the"],[14.16,14.82,"process"],[14.94,15.64,"Twenty-seven"],[15.7,16.02,"club"],[16.12,16.42,"lookin'"],[16.5,16.72,"good,"],[16.84,16.94,"to"],[17.04,17.12,"be"],[17.3,17.98,"honest